/- ---------------------------------------------------------------------- -/
/- Session wiring for Multivariate/measure.ml.                            -/
/- ---------------------------------------------------------------------- -/
/- File: SessionMultiLib/Measure.lean

  The session half of the measure.ml translation: it supplies
  HolMultiLib.Measure's dependencies (integration.ml's `IntegrationDeps`
  and the extra theorems from Session, SessionLibrary and SessionMultiLib),
  and exports every theorem by name.  Importing this module is
  `needs "Multivariate/measure.ml"`: its own `needs` (Library/card.ml,
  Library/permutations.ml, integration.ml and determinants.ml) are its
  imports, and each bundle is built by `initialize` when the module is
  loaded, in file order.
-/

